the manner in which the right of access to documents and the right to entry conferred by Section 9 may be exercised ;
(j)
the manner in which a check-post or barrier may be set up or erected and the form of documents under Section 13 ;
(k)
the procedure and manner for payment of fees under this Act and of money payable because of composition of offence
under Section 15 ;
(l)
the amount of levy or duty and the manner for payment of such levy or duty for forest produce removed out of the State ;
(m)
any other matter which is to be or may be prescribed.
